      "message": "There\u0027s a race condition here.\n\n1. Some undesired event causes __wait_evt() to exit\n2. Deadline expires\n3. We break here\n\nBut then events \u0026 event_mask \u003d 0.  Try:\n\n  while (!(events \u0026 event_mask)) {\n    time_remaining_us \u003d deadline - get_time().val;\n    if (time_remaining_us \u003e 0)\n      events \u003d __wait_evt(time_remaining_us, TASK_ID_IDLE);\n    else\n      events |\u003d TASK_EVENT_TIMER;  /* Timeout */\n\n    other_events |\u003d events \u0026 ~event_mask;\n  }",
